n```\n\n---\n\n#### (2) `cat .opencode/service/session-harness.ts` → ❌ 文件不存在\n\n路径 `.opencode/service/session-harness.ts` **不存在**。这个文件不在磁盘上。类似的路径前缀是 `.opencode/service/session/` 目录下的文件（如 `lifecycle.ts`）。\n\n---\n\n#### (3) `git status` → ✅ 成功 (via `safe_repo_status`)\n\n**Modified (staged and unstaged):** 52 个文件已修改，包括：\n- `AGENTS.md`, `opencode.json`, `package.json`, `tsconfig.json`\n- `.opencode/agents/Orchestrator.md`\n- 多个 `.opencode/service/**/*.ts`（dispatch、gate、session 等）\n- 多个 `.opencode/plugin-handlers/**/*.ts`\n- `.opencode/tools/dispatch_subagent.ts`, `safe_framework_edit.ts`\n- `.opencode/rules/common/common-project.md`, `mcp-compliance-guide.md`\n- `.opencode/scripts/mcp-tools/compliance-gate.ts`\n\n**Untracked (新文件):** 16 个新文件/目录，例如：\n- `.github/workflows/lint-and-test.yml`\n- `.opencode/plugin-handlers/before/gate-call-context.ts`\n- `.opencode/service/dispatch/framework-maintenance-plan.ts`\n- `.opencode/service/tool-governance/`（新目录）\n- `.opencode/tools/framework_maintenance_complete.ts`, `framework_maintenance_plan.ts`\n- `scripts/db-query.ts`, `scripts/db-schema.ts`\n- `plans/`, `.reasonix/`\n\n**Summary:** 大量 `.opencode/` 框架文件处于已修改状态，工作目录不干净。","time":{"start":1783760839474,"end":1783760844621},"id":"prt_f506e6331001CI8h2kzy1H6deo","sessionID":"ses_0af91d55cffeX1483eKLN2CpVJ","messageID":"msg_f506e561e001tdvU4OIia2EB5a"},{"reason":"stop","snapshot":"7b112e7d130fa08e5f068450e3b9e058c97a959e","type":"step-finish","tokens":{"total":65564,"input":1858,"output":677,"reasoning":53,"cache":{"write":0,"read":62976}},"cost":0.0006408528,"id":"prt_f506e775d001CNy0gsJo6FPyEU","sessionID":"ses_0af91d55cffeX1483eKLN2CpVJ","messageID":"msg_f506e561e001tdvU4OIia2EB5a"}]}